id: pm-brief-changelog-lf
title: Preserve generated changelog bytes on Windows checkouts
description: Move the existing changelog attribute and checkout regression from PR #228 into a standalone change. A Windows-style Git checkout without the attribute changes the generated bytes and breaks changelog validation.
type: Chore
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags[2]: changelog,ci
created_at: "2026-11-23T00:10:08.265Z"
updated_at: "2026-11-23T22:32:38.743Z"
author: codex-agent
acceptance_criteria: The real Git conversion regression fails without the LF attribute and passes with it.
comments[2]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-23T22:32:11.651Z",codex-agent,Move the canonical LF attribute and real Git checkout regression to the standalone branch. Verify the new test detects the checkout-byte failure without the attribute.
  "2026-11-23T22:32:35.426Z",codex-agent,"The Windows-style Git checkout regression fails on the LF-byte assertion when only the changelog attribute is reverted. With the attribute restored, the checkout and identity tests pass."
